# Title: Disable Security Events Logging Adding Reg Key MiniNt
# ID: 919f2ef0-be2d-4a7a-b635-eb2b41fde044
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Ilyas Ochkov, oscd.community
# Date: 2019-10-25
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.001, attack.t1112, car.2022-03-001
# Description: Detects the addition of a key 'MiniNt' to the registry. Upon a reboot, Windows Event Log service will stop writing events.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((registry.path:"HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\MiniNt" AND EventType:"CreateKey") OR (NewName:"HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\MiniNt"))
